    "posts": [
      {
        "id": 19619,
        "name": "wolfkinara",
        "username": "wolfkinara",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/e95f7d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-12-11T06:11:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When you play with the expansion do you just add all of the new power cards to the old ones? When I first got Branch and Claw I used only the expansion cards (mostly because I was excited and wanted to try to learn them all as quick as possible), but then found that I missed some of the classic power cards that I had gotten used to. And then when I mixed the decks together I felt like I wasn't getting enough use out of the expansion tokens. So now I set up the deck with all of the Branch and Claw cards, and about half of the base game cards and I feel like it's an okay balance.</p>\n<p>What do you all do? Have you had a similar experience?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:22.418Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 344,
        "reads": 1,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 1720.2,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 19618,
        "topic_slug": "branch-and-claw-power-cards",
        "display_username": "wolfkinara",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>When you play with the expansion do you just add all of the new power cards to the old ones? When I first got Branch and Claw I used only the expansion cards (mostly because I was excited and wanted to try to learn them all as quick as possible), but then found that I missed some of the classic power cards that I had gotten used to. And then when I mixed the decks together I felt like I wasn't getting enough use out of the expansion tokens. So now I set up the deck with all of the Branch and Claw cards, and about half of the base game cards and I feel like it's an okay balance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What do you all do? Have you had a similar experience?</p>",
