        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>You should use all of the power cards from both the base game and the expansion together*. Among other things, removing a subset of the cards is likely to skew the distribution of elements and effects. The result of this may or may not be noticeable, depending on what you include and which spirits you're using.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>There is a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4g8ow\">FAQ</a> that doesn't exactly answer your question (it talks about using all of the base game cards and a subset of the B&amp;C powers), but has information you might find interesting about including different elements from the expansion.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>*Obviously, do whatever is most fun for you.</p>",
